1. CREATE A NEW FOLDER NAMED- DOCKER-DEMO
2. CREATE 3 FILES IN THAT - 1. INDEX.HTML 2. DOCKERFILE 3. docker-compose.yml
3. index.html 
    <h1> hi welcome to container </h1>
4. dockerfile
    FROM nginx
    COPY html /usr/share/nginx/html/index.html
5. docker-compose.yml
    version:'3'
    services:
      web1:
        image: nginx
        ports:
          - "8081:80"
      web2:
        image: nginx
        ports:
          - "8082:80"
6. GO TO DOCKER-DEMO FOLDER PATH -> CTRL A -> cmd
7. docker build -t myimage .
8. docker run -d -p 8080:80 --name myimages myimage
9. docker-compose up -d
10 docker ps
11 docker-compose down
